OL,3,GNEWSAQuad bike seized after ride 'with
OL,4,Ababies up front'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA quad bike has been seized by
OL,7,Fauthorities in Stoke-on-Trent after
OL,8,Fcomplaints about antisocial riding
OL,9,Fwhich included a report of babies being
OL,10,Fpositioned on the front of the vehicle.
OL,12,FCity council officers worked alongside
OL,13,FStaffordshire Police following reports
OL,14,Fof a quad bike being used irresponsibly
OL,15,Fin the Bentilee area.
OL,17,FIn addition to the babies incident
OL,18,Fwhere the council said there was no
OL,19,Fregard for safety, other reports stated
OL,20,Fchildren were riding the vehicle
OL,21,Funsupervised.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
